; Horace's animation counter (byte)
;
; Incremented by #R$6821 (entry DrawHorace_Sprite) each time Horace is drawn, including the death sequence. Bit 4
; chooses between the two walking frames (#R$7CC7 when set, #R$7D47 when clear), so the frame changes every 16 draws.
; Never reset; starts at 0.
;
@label=HoraceAnim
g$7C72 DEFB $00
